#--- slot.yaml
# S2: one marked non-leaf slot slice (150 bytes, overflows the 128-byte low
# window on its own) plus one marked 4-byte global slice that fits.  The slot
# is the failing section AND a candidate, so the fallback migrates it directly.
--- !ELF
FileHeader:
